# Line endings: store and check out every text file with LF (Unix)
# line endings, on every computer. Without this, Git on Windows warns
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" every time it touches a file.
# LF is what Expo, Metro, EAS Build and every Mac/Linux tool expect,
# and VS Code on Windows handles it fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these, whatever they look like.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.zip binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
